<Slide style={{ background: '#F0E4D2' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 120, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 40, background: '#7E9476', borderRadius: 4 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3E2A1E' }}>你需要準備嘅嘢（先決條件）</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 540, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 6, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1.3, gap: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 38, height: 38, borderRadius: 19, background: '#7E9476', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <svg width={20} height={20} viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' strokeWidth='2' strokeLinecap='round' strokeLinejoin='round'><circle cx='12' cy='8' r='4'/><path d='M4 21c0-4 3.5-6 8-6s8 2 8 6'/></svg>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#3E2A1E' }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>AWS 帳號</span>：去 aws.amazon.com 免費開（需要 email 同電話）</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 38, height: 38, borderRadius: 19, background: '#7E9476', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <svg width={20} height={20} viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' strokeWidth='2' strokeLinecap='round' strokeLinejoin='round'><rect x='3' y='7' width='18' height='10' rx='2'/><line x1='3' y1='11' x2='21' y2='11'/></svg>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#3E2A1E' }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>信用卡 / 扣帳卡</span>：用嚟驗證身份，會有 $1 授權（之後退返）</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 38, height: 38, borderRadius: 19, background: '#7E9476', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <svg width={20} height={20} viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' strokeWidth='2' strokeLinecap='round' strokeLinejoin='round'><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='9'/><ellipse cx='12' cy='12' rx='4' ry='9'/><line x1='3' y1='12' x2='21' y2='12'/></svg>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#3E2A1E' }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>網域（建議）</span>：例如 aurora-clinic.com，約每年 $10–15 美金（冇都得，先用 EC2 臨時網址）</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 38, height: 38, borderRadius: 19, background: '#7E9476', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <svg width={20} height={20} viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' strokeWidth='2' strokeLinecap='round' strokeLinejoin='round'><rect x='4' y='5' width='16' height='11' rx='1'/><line x1='2' y1='20' x2='22' y2='20'/></svg>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#3E2A1E' }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>一部電腦 + 上網</span>：Windows / Mac 都得，教學用瀏覽器操作，唔使裝額外軟件</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#5D4037', borderRadius: 14, padding: '22px 22px', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F0E4D2' }}>新手小貼士</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#F0E4D2', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 12 }}>你而家個網站（Express + SQLite + Vue）已經可以原封不動搬上去 AWS，唔使改 code。跟住第 7–17 頁做就得。準備好就開始！</Text>
